        "en": "Communication regarding treatment plans and prescriptions elicits noticeable client criticism. Multiple pet owners report inadequate guidance following appointments, including unaddressed concerns and rigid prescription refill processes. While some reviewers appreciate transparent dialogue during exams, others note difficulty reaching clinicians for timely updates."
      }
